Provider button marks for Settings "Get API Key" buttons.
Trademarks of the respective companies; used only to link to their signup pages.

Ship {stem}_16.png, {stem}_32.png, and {stem}_48.png. UnoControlButton does not
scale graphics to the button. Settings picks the size from VCL DPI via
provider_icon_filename (1× → 16, mid → 32, HiDPI ~2× → 48). Do not use
getPosSize height thresholds — AppFont before execute would keep tiny icons on
HiDPI.

huggingface_48.png (and _16/_32 downscales)
  Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/huggingface/brand-assets/resolve/main/hf-logo.png
  Brand: https://huggingface.co/brand

together_48.png (and _16/_32 downscales)
  Source: Together AI official logo suite (PNG/Color+Black/TogetherAI_Logo_021026_Logo.png)
  Brand: https://www.together.ai/brand

openrouter_48.png (and _16/_32 downscales)
  Source: https://openrouter.ai/apple-touch-icon.png (new OR mark, 2026 brand refresh)

nvidia_48.png (and _16/_32 downscales)
  Source: https://www.nvidia.com/favicon.ico
  There is no NVIDIA NIM-specific mark; this is the NVIDIA eye. NIM is the product name.

Regenerate: from the 48×48 masters, Lanczos-scale to 16 and 32 (ffmpeg or Pillow).
This NOTICE is excluded from the OXT (see should_exclude).
